1:1 COMMENT "# generator_map_filter.z -- a two-stage generator pipeline."
1:60 EOL "\n"
2:1 COMMENT "#"
2:2 EOL "\n"
3:1 COMMENT "# `IntRange` produces a finite stream of integers; `Doubled`"
3:61 EOL "\n"
4:1 COMMENT "# transforms each one (the map stage); `GreaterThan` keeps only the"
4:68 EOL "\n"
5:1 COMMENT "# values above a threshold (the filter stage); `main` drives the"
5:65 EOL "\n"
6:1 COMMENT "# composed pipeline."
6:21 EOL "\n"
7:1 COMMENT "#"
7:2 EOL "\n"
8:1 COMMENT "# Each stage is a generator with its own construction state that"
8:65 EOL "\n"
9:1 COMMENT "# builds the next stage inline as the for-loop's iterable. A"
9:61 EOL "\n"
10:1 COMMENT "# for-loop iterable that is a construction is hoisted to a temp"
10:64 EOL "\n"
11:1 COMMENT "# before the loop, and that temp crosses the enclosing generator's"
11:67 EOL "\n"
12:1 COMMENT "# suspensions, so the sub-iterator is promoted to a field of the"
12:65 EOL "\n"
13:1 COMMENT "# outer one and persists across `.call` invocations."
13:53 EOL "\n"
14:1 COMMENT "#"
14:2 EOL "\n"
15:1 COMMENT "# Pipeline shape:"
15:18 EOL "\n"
16:1 COMMENT "#   IntRange  --(yields)-->  Doubled  --(yields)-->  GreaterThan"
16:65 EOL "\n"
17:1 COMMENT "#"
17:2 EOL "\n"
18:1 COMMENT "# For `lo: 1, hi: 6` the inner IntRange yields 1..5; Doubled emits"
18:67 EOL "\n"
19:1 COMMENT "# 2/4/6/8/10; GreaterThan(threshold: 5) keeps 6/8/10."
19:54 EOL "\n"
20:1 COMMENT "# See doc/spec.pdoc Generator functions / Composability."
20:57 EOL "\n"
21:1 EOL "\n"
